‘SBSDKBaseScannerViewController’ and its subclasses.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Sometimes it is necessary to limit a live video frame detection or recognition to a certain rectangular area with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a specific aspect ratio: the region or rectangle of interest. This is where a view finder comes in."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"It crops the video frame to that region of interest before passing it to any scanner. Usually","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the performance of scanners gain a benefit from it because less pixels must be processed.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Additionally, to guide the user, the view finder visualizes the region of interest by drawing a rectangle around"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"on the user interface.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkbasescannerviewfinderconfiguration"},"doc://net.doo.ScanbotSDK/documentation/ScanbotSDK":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/scanbotsdk","title":"ScanbotSDK","identifier":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK","abstract":[{"text":"Version: 7.0.0","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://net.doo.ScanbotSDK/documentation/ScanbotSDK/SBSDKBaseScannerViewFinderConfiguration/aspectRatio":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"aspectRatio"}],"title":"aspectRatio","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The aspect ratio of the region of inter